#: includes/Config.php:319
msgid "Maximum storage size for browser analysis in MB"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Config.php:320
msgid "Up to this WordPress-reported storage usage, the storage analysis can run in browser batches. Larger websites are processed exclusively by scheduled background tasks."
